  "sourceTitle": "Cloudflare OS: your company’s agent workspace, managed for you",
  "sourceBodyHash": "f6b1868007b5e6a57f318d9aadd1cfa567a51e3543c92438cacfeebef444acf8",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "partial",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-02T02:40:59.273844Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-02T02:41:52.783734Z",
  "totalBlocks": 24,
  "translatedBlocks": 16,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b70ec356e27719be",
      "translationZh": "通过全托管选项，您可以决定谁可以访问 Cloudflare OS、可以使用哪些组织技能和上下文，以及它可以访问哪些系统。其余部分您可以交给我们处理。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16f0a7b97d30154a",
      "translationZh": "如果您希望为您的组织获取 Cloudflare OS 的全托管服务，请加入候补名单，我们会与您联系。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2ab1455c182f0f26",
      "translationZh": "Cloudflare OS 的新功能",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "469f54680aec54bc",
      "translationZh": "在过去的一个月里，我们也致力于扩展人员和智能体在 Cloudflare OS 中的功能。以下是一些亮点。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "dd6290b7d42433eb",
      "translationZh": "挂载 Git 仓库并进行代码工作",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a1dfdcdd6157844d",
      "translationZh": "当我们推出 Cloudflare OS 时，我们首先关注的是软件开发之外的工作：创建文档和幻灯片、自动化任务以及构建协作工具。智能体可以为应用程序编写代码，但无法在现有的 Git 仓库中处理代码。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0f9bc29a34a37a0",
      "translationZh": "您现在可以将现有的 GitHub 仓库连接到 Cloudflare OS。让您的智能体探索代码库、修复漏洞、添加功能或发起拉取请求。它可以搜索并编辑文件、审查其更改、创建提交并将其推送到 GitHub。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f682ef4118668b46",
      "translationZh": "跨 Google Workspace 工作",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "13639131e2abf773",
      "translationZh": "对于许多组织而言，工作始于 Google Workspace，也终于 Google Workspace。决策存在于电子邮件线程中，上下文信息存在于 Google Drive 中，分析在 Sheets 中进行，而团队通过 Calendar 进行协作。智能体（Agents）也需要跨这些系统开展工作。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5943497ec46aefeb",
      "translationZh": "我们对 Google Workspace Gatekeeper（一种位于 Cloudflare OS 与外部服务之间的特定服务 Worker）进行了重大改进。Cloudflare OS 现在可以读取并研究 Gmail 线程、创建草稿并发送电子邮件。您还可以连接您的整个 Google Drive、特定文件夹或单个文档或表格。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e4cfe253db8a4e52",
      "translationZh": "以您团队使用的格式导出工作内容",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a5f4b60de124065",
      "translationZh": "工作内容通常需要转换为您团队已经使用的格式。财务部门可能需要 Excel 表格，而报告在发送给客户之前可能需要转换为 PDF。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "667d62f4cfffeea4",
      "translationZh": "内置的文档、演示文稿和电子表格体验现在可以将工作导出为熟悉的格式。根据您创建的内容，您可以导出为 Microsoft Excel (.xlsx)、CSV、PDF、Markdown 或 HTML。Microsoft Word (.docx) 和 PowerPoint (.pptx) 的导出功能即将推出。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6f92a3f6d7c0804",
      "translationZh": "您构建的工具也可以定义自己的导出格式。告诉智能体您的需求，例如“让我将此日程表下载为日历文件 (.ics)”，它就会将该选项添加到工具的导出菜单中。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a6bb37f4856eb7bf",
      "translationZh": "Cloudflare OS 是开源的，并且即日起可用。您可以查看源代码或将其部署到您自己的 Cloudflare 账户中。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e9932d7a9adaeab2",
      "translationZh": "如果您希望为您的组织提供 Cloudflare OS 全托管服务，请加入等候名单，我们会联系您并提供更多信息。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
